WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:07.000
Claude Code: claude -p with --output-format json and no tools, piped through jq.

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:13.000
The reply is one JSON object. jq keeps three stable fields: type, is_error and result.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Codex: codex exec --json in a read-only sandbox prints one JSON event per line.

4
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:32.000
jq selects the agent_message event. Its text is the answer.
